      "type": "{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What does the Calendly integration do?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It adds a scheduler field to your form so respondents can book a meeting on your Calendly while filling out the form — no separate booking step.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I add Calendly to a form?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Click Add Elements → Appointment Scheduler (under Date & Time), choose Calendly under Schedule With, paste your Calendly link, and publish.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the booking reuse their name and email?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes — enable autofill in the field properties and the respondent's name and email carry into the Calendly booking.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kinds of meetings can people book?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Anything your Calendly offers — demos, consultations, interviews, support calls — controlled by the appointment link you paste in.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is Formester?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Formester is an online form builder for creating forms, surveys, and quizzes with a drag-and-drop editor or AI. It connects with the tools your team already uses — Google Sheets, Slack, HubSpot, Zapier, and more — so your form data flows wherever you need it.\"}}]}"
